@startuml
title LTE Low-Band + NR Mid-Band (Coverage Mismatch)

actor UE
participant LTE as "eNB (700 MHz)"
participant NR as "gNB (3.5 GHz)"

UE -> LTE: RRC Connection Setup
LTE -> NR: EN-DC Addition Request
NR -> LTE: EN-DC Addition Request Ack
LTE -> UE: RRC Reconfiguration (Add NR)
alt NR RSRP above threshold
    UE -> NR: RRC Connection Setup
    UE -> LTE: RRC Reconfiguration Complete
    LTE -> NR: Data Split Activated
else NR below threshold
    LTE -> UE: RRC Reconfiguration Cancel (Keep LTE only)
end
@enduml
